<title>BRAZIL: ATHLETICS-SAO SILVESTRE ROAD RACE RESULT.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-SAO SILVESTRE ROAD RACE RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the Sao Silvestre 15 kilometre road race through the streets of Sao Paulo on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Women's race  1. Roseli Machado (Brazil)   52 minutes 32 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Maria del Carmen Diaz (Mexico)    53.13</p>
<p> 3. Esther Kiplagat (Kenya)	     53.38</p>
